OPNsense plugin for bidirectional AbuseIPDB integration.

Features:
 * Automatic download of AbuseIPDB blacklist into a pf table
 * Firewall alias integration for easy rule setup
 * Log-based reporter: submit local firewall hits back to AbuseIPDB
 * Dashboard widget with block / report / quota statistics
 * Fire-and-forget: scheduled via cron, no manual maintenance

WWW: https://github.com/KaiOppi/os-abuseipdb
